{
  "name": "PracticeQ Superbills -> client files",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtMinute": 20
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "1a0f8f2e-0001-4c1e-9a5e-000000000001",
      "name": "Every hour",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://superbill:8080/sync",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "since_days",
              "value": "3"
            }
          ]
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "1a0f8f2e-0002-4c1e-9a5e-000000000002",
      "name": "Start superbill sync",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "Superbill service (X-Superbill-Secret)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 12,
        "unit": "minutes"
      },
      "id": "1a0f8f2e-0003-4c1e-9a5e-000000000003",
      "name": "Wait for the run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        520,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "1a0f8f2e-0003-4c1e-9a5e-000000000003"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://superbill:8080/status",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a0f8f2e-0004-4c1e-9a5e-000000000004",
      "name": "Read sync result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        780,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "name": "Superbill service (X-Superbill-Secret)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.last && ($json.last.error || $json.last['error'] > 0)) ? 1 : 0 }}",
              "rightValue": 1,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a0f8f2e-0005-4c1e-9a5e-000000000005",
      "name": "Any errors?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1040,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Superbill sync\n\nHourly: POST /sync on the superbill service (superbill/ in the first_one repo), which rebuilds the superbill PDF for every client with a visit completed in the last 3 days and replaces it in the client's Files tab in PracticeQ.\n\nSetup:\n1. The two HTTP nodes call http://superbill:8080 (the container from deploy/docker-compose.superbill.yml on this host). Change the URL in both if it runs elsewhere.\n2. Credential (Header Auth) named \"Superbill service (X-Superbill-Secret)\": header name X-Superbill-Secret, value = SUPERBILL_SECRET of the service.\n3. Optional: wire the \"true\" branch of \"Any errors?\" to a Gmail/Slack node.\n\nCompletion is time-based (a Confirmed visit whose end time has passed), so a schedule is required; the PracticeQ appointment webhook already belongs to the GHL workflow and is not touched.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "1a0f8f2e-0006-4c1e-9a5e-000000000006",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -380
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every hour": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Start superbill sync",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Start superbill sync": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Wait for the run",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Wait for the run": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read sync result",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read sync result": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Any errors?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "timezone": "America/New_York"
  },
  "active": false
}